-- inventory.talk: prices an order from the Host's catalogue, then reserves it
-- with the Host's warehouse, which answers later.
-- Grants: catalogue (price, immediate) and warehouse (reserve, suspending).

on order sku, quantity
  ask catalogue to price sku
  put it * quantity into total
  try
    ask warehouse to reserve sku, quantity and wait
    return {sku: sku, total: total, reservation: it}
  catch {code: code}
    return {sku: sku, total: total, failed: code}
  end try
end order
